<title>USA: Diatide granted two U.S. patents.</title>
<headline>Diatide granted two U.S. patents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDONDERRY, N.H. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diatide Inc said on Friday it was granted two U.S. patents connected with P483H Techtide, a product determining the location of internal infections.</p>
<p>One of the patents granted by the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office covers radiopharmaceuticals comprising peptides derived from platelet factor 4, known to attract and bind with white blood cells.</p>
<p>The other covers radiopharmaceuticals comprising polybasic compounds in combination with polysulfated glycans.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
